000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SPOSINST.
000500 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800
000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*     S P O S I N S T                                *
001200*    SUBROUTINE FOR SELECTING STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS. *
001300*    THIS PROGRAM DISPLAYS A SCREEN FOR SELECTING    *
001400*    STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS AND CONFIRMING ORDER      *
001500*    VERBAGE FOR PRINT PURPOSES.  ONCE THE           *
001600*    SELECTIONS ARE MADE THEY ARE RETURNED TO THE    *
001700*    CALLING PROGRAM.   THE FORM USED BY THIS        *
001800*    SUBROUTINE IS 'PURORD4' AND IS LOCATED IN THE   *
001900*    FORMFILE 'VPURORD.FLANG001' THEREFORE THIS      *
002000*    FORMFILE MUST BE OPENED FIRST.                  *
002100*    PO NUMBER IS OPTIONAL BUT IF IT IS PASSED IT    *
002200*    WILL BE DISPLAYED ON THE SCREEN.                *
002300*    COMPANY CODE SHOULD BE PASSED FOR SCREEN        *
002400*    DISPLAY PURPOSES.                               *
002500*                                                    *
002600*      01 SPOSINST-PARMS.                            *
002700*         05  SPOSINST-STD-INST X(36) - ARRAY        *
002800*              CONTAINING UP TO 12 (3 BYTE) STANDARD *
002900*              INSTRUCTIONS                          *
003000*         05  SPOSINST-CONFIRMING-FLAG  X(1) - 'X'   *
003100*              DENOTES THIS IS A CONFIRMING ORDER    *
003200*         05  SPOSINST-CONFIRM-VERBAGE X(34) -       *
003300*              CONFIRMING ORDER FREE VERBAGE WHICH   *
003400*              IS OPTIONAL                           *
003500*         05  SPOSINST-COMPANY-CODE X(3) - COMPANY   *
003600*              CODE WHICH SHOULD BE PASSED BY        *
003700*              CALLING PROGRAM.                      *
003800*                                                    *
003900*        SPOSINST-STD-INST, SPOSINST-CONFIRMING-FLAG,*
004000*        SPOSINST-CONFIRM-VERBAGE ARE THE VARIABLES  *
004100*        RETURNED BY THIS SUBROUTINE.                *
004200******************************************************
      *C
      *C  02/03/1998   CA YODER   REQ #97-018
      *C    COMMENTED OUT SENTENCE TO MOVE SPACES TO STANDARD
      *C    INSTRUCTIONS PARAMETER SINCE TPURORD WILL BE FILLING
      *C    IN VALUES FROM DVENDOR IF THEY EXIST.
      *C
004300
004400
004500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
004800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
004900
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
005100
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPURORD-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MCOMMENT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1801
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DCOMMENT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

005200 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                  PIC X(2000).
      *    COPY DD-PURORD4-O OF ZPURORD.

       FD  MCOMMENT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCOMMENT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1801.

       FD  DCOMMENT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCOMMENT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1901.

005300
005400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

005600
005700**********************
005800*                    *
005900*  S W I T C H E S   *
006000*                    *
006100**********************
006200
006300 01  SWITCH-AREA.
006400     05  FATAL-ERR-SW             PIC X   VALUE SPACES.
006600
006700 01  SAVE-AREAS.
006800     05  SAVE-COND-WORD           PIC S9(4)  COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
006900
007000 01  SUB-AREA  COMP-4.
007100     05  SUB                     PIC S99     VALUE ZEROS.
007200     05  INST-SUB                PIC S99     VALUE ZEROS.
007300
007400
