011700**                                                          **
011800**             TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                       **
011900**                                                          **
012000**************************************************************
012100**************************************************************
012200
012300 01  SCREEN-4.
012400     05  DE4-COMPANY-CODE            PIC X(3).
012500     05  DE4-PO                      PIC X(7).
012600     05  DE4-PO-REL                    PIC X(3).
012700     05  DE4-CONFIRMING-ORDER        PIC X.
012800     05  DE4-CONFIRMING-VERB         PIC X(34).
012900     05  DE4-INSTRUCT-LIST.
013000         10  DE4-INSTRUCT-NO  OCCURS 12 TIMES   PIC X(3).
012900     05  DE4-RCV-INSTRUCT-LIST.
013000         10  DE4-RCV-INSTRUCT-NO  OCCURS 12 TIMES   PIC X(3).
013100     05  DE4-INSTRUCT-INQ.
013200         10  DE4-INSTRUCT-TABLE OCCURS 8 TIMES.
                   15  DE4-INST-TYPE       PIC X(1).
013300             15  DE4-INST-NO         PIC X(3).
013400             15  DE4-INST-FIRST-LINE PIC X(72).
013500     05  DE4-MSG                     PIC X(68).
           05  DE4-COMMAND-LINE            PIC X(79).
           05  DE4-MESSAGE-LINE            PIC X(79).
