069600
069700 64-SAVE-STD-INST.
069800     MOVE DE4-INSTRUCT-LIST       TO SPOSINST-STD-INST.
069900     MOVE DE4-CONFIRMING-ORDER    TO SPOSINST-CONFIRMING-FLAG.
070000     MOVE DE4-CONFIRMING-VERB     TO SPOSINST-CONFIRM-VERBAGE.
           MOVE DE4-RCV-INSTRUCT-LIST   TO SPOSINST-RCV-INST.
070100
070200 64-PSI-X.
